{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35847","headline":"和彭进士秋日游靖居山寺 · 李咸用","name":"和彭进士秋日游靖居山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋山入望已无尘，况得闲游谢事频。\n问着尽能言祖祖，见时应不是真真。\n添瓶野水遮还急，伴塔幽花落又新。\n自笑未曾同逸步，终非宗炳社中人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李咸用","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_35847.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_35847","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}